---
// Quiz figure for Post 9: a generic pricing card as a vague prompt returns it (14px padding, flat type, two equal buttons).
---
<div class="qfig-uxq09price">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 440 250" role="img" aria-label="A pricing card with a title and price in the same small bold type, thick dividers, three bullet lines and two equally weighted buttons.">
    <rect x="10" y="10" width="420" height="230" rx="4" class="card" />
    <text x="24" y="38" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Pro Plan, Most Popular</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Gói Pro, phổ biến nhất</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="60" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>$49 / month per user</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>$49 / tháng mỗi người</tspan></text>
    <line x1="24" y1="72" x2="416" y2="72" class="hr" />
    <text x="24" y="94" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Unlimited projects and team members</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Không giới hạn dự án và thành viên</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="114" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Priority support and audit logs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Hỗ trợ ưu tiên và nhật ký kiểm tra</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="134" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>• Custom domains and analytics</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>• Tên miền riêng và bảng thống kê</tspan></text>
    <line x1="24" y1="150" x2="416" y2="150" class="hr" />
    <rect x="24" y="164" width="188" height="38" rx="4" class="btn" />
    <text x="118" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="bt"><tspan data-lang-en>Compare plans</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>So sánh gói</tspan></text>
    <rect x="224" y="164" width="192" height="38" rx="4" class="btn" />
    <text x="320" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="bt"><tspan data-lang-en>Buy now</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua ngay</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq09price { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq09price svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq09price text { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 14px; }
  .qfig-uxq09price .t { fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-uxq09price .b { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .qfig-uxq09price .bt { fill: var(--bg); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-uxq09price .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-uxq09price .hr { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 3; }
  .qfig-uxq09price .btn { fill: var(--accent); }
</style>
